,[29925,38.9,1964,71,97,18]],"links":[["Franklin County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/new-york/franklin-county"],["ARC or PLC in Franklin County","/arc-plc/new-york/franklin-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 15 grids in Franklin County came in under 90% of normal in April to May in 32 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025, the middle of the grids ran 60% of normal in August to September and 67% in July to August. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 136% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 29622 had its driest year in 1955 at 78% of normal.</p>"}
